result = add(3, 4)\n\"\"\"\n\nast = compile(code)\nprintln(ast)\n```\n\n## 📈 진행도\n\n- Phase 1: ⏳ 진행중\n- Phase 2.1-2.5: ⏳ 예정\n- Phase 3 (Self-hosting): ⏳ 예정\n\n---\n\n**목표**: Julia 컴파일러 자신으로 Julia 코드를 컴파일할 수 있는 자체 호스팅 컴파일러 완성\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4111,"cache_read_input_tokens":70918,"output_tokens":1699,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4111,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYvn4LnV6dnFTiJyghtFW","type":"assistant","uuid":"91ee1b43-b514-4a42-80da-5e86a06cada3","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:56:46.354Z"}
