ample=\"hello\">👋 Hello World</button>\n            <button class=\"example-btn\" data-example=\"factorial\">🔢 팩토리얼</button>\n            <button class=\"example-btn\" data-example=\"multiplication\">📊 구구단</button>\n            <button class=\"example-btn\" data-example=\"array\">📦 배열 연산</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- 기능 소개 -->\n    <section class=\"features\">\n      <h2>✨ MiniScript의 특징</h2>\n      <div class=\"features-grid\">\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <h3>📌 변수</h3>\n          <code>let x = 10;<br>const PI = 3.14;</code>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <h3>🔄 제어 흐름</h3>\n          <code>if (x > 5) { ... }<br>for (let i = 0; i < 10; i = i + 1) { ... }</code>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <h3>🔧 함수</h3>\n          <code>fn add(a, b) {<br>  return a + b;<br>}</code>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <h3>📦 배열</h3>\n          <code>let arr = [1, 2, 3];<br>println(arr[0]);</code>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 문법 가이드 -->\n    <section class=\"syntax-guide\">\n      <h2>📖 기본 문법</h2>\n      <div class=\"guide-content\">\n        <div class=\"guide-item\">\n          <h4>출력 함수</h4>\n          <code>print(\"Hello\");<br>println(\"Hello with newline\");</code>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"guide-item\">\n          <h4>배열 함수</h4>\n          <code>length(arr) - 배열 크기<br>push(arr, value) - 요소 추가<br>pop(arr) - 마지막 요소 제거</code>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"guide-item\">\n          <h4>유틸리티</h4>\n          <code>type(value) - 값의 타입<br>range(n) - 0~n-1 배열 생성</code>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 푸터 -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <p>🎓 MiniScript Web Interpreter v1.0 | Built with JavaScript</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 로딩 표시 -->\n  <div id=\"loadingOverlay\" class=\"loading-overlay\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"spinner\"></div>\